E6. Relational Algebra view: each Query Library entry has hand-written RA (selection, projection, join, rename, union, difference, division, aggregation) with a rendered query tree. For arbitrary Workbench queries, offer "Generate RA with AI" (Gemini, labelled "AI-generated, verify").
E7. ACID and Concurrency Lab, with the label "Simulation" where applicable:
